{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきゃーっっ５月２日セカンドシングルおいでシャンプー発売(*'▽'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして秋元康先生のお誕生日です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやってセカンドシングルおいでシャンプーがあるのも秋元康先生のおかげです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーーー嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8770450/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通常盤、CDジャケットの後ろにぼやーっといるハーフツインは川後なんです(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ探してね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、レッスンやってーみんなおってさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーと狼に口笛を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を見せ合いっこをはじめしたんやけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「狼に口笛を」選抜のまえでやりよたっちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらさ、うちらのダンスみてさ感動してさー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりん＊がめっちゃ号泣してくれてさ(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらそれ以外の選抜もうるうるしとって(; ;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したら、アンダーもそれが嬉しくて泣いてさ(/_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうさ、乃木坂ってチームワーク凄いなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea